From: Kyvenza <support@kyvenza.com>
Date: Thu, 11 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] vdagent: announce a capability bit for the Kyvenza file-list clipboard format

The host has no way to tell whether the agent inside the guest understands
VD_AGENT_CLIPBOARD_FILE_LIST (patch 0004).  An older agent simply skips the
format, so pasting files from the host silently does nothing and the user has
no clue that the guest tools need a reinstall.

Announce capability bit 28, chosen well above VD_AGENT_END_CAP (14) and inside
the single uint32_t the capabilities bitmap has.  The host treats a missing bit
as "guest tools out of date" and says so in the UI.

Signed-off-by: Kyvenza <support@kyvenza.com>
---
--- a/vdagent/vdagent.cpp
+++ b/vdagent/vdagent.cpp
@@ -71,6 +71,11 @@
 /* 粘贴完不能马上删:资源管理器是异步复制的,删早了它会复制到空文件。
  * 所以只在下一次粘贴时清掉**足够旧**的那些。 */
 #define VD_CLIP_FILES_KEEP_MS (10 * 60 * 1000)
+/* Kyvenza: 能力位 28,也是我们自己占的号(上游到 FILE_XFER_DETAILED_ERRORS = 14 为止,
+ * 位图只有一个 u32,28 在范围内)。宿主靠它判断客体里装的 agent 认不认上面那个
+ * 文件粘贴格式:老版本不宣告这一位,宿主就能在界面上提示"客体工具需要更新",
+ * 而不是让用户对着一个"粘贴了什么也没发生"的剪贴板猜。 */
+#define VD_AGENT_CAP_KYVENZA_CLIPBOARD_FILE_LIST 28
 
 // only in vista+, not yet in mingw
 #ifndef WM_CLIPBOARDUPDATE
@@ -1121,6 +1126,8 @@
     VD_AGENT_SET_CAPABILITY(caps->caps, VD_AGENT_CAP_SPARSE_MONITORS_CONFIG);
     VD_AGENT_SET_CAPABILITY(caps->caps, VD_AGENT_CAP_GUEST_LINEEND_CRLF);
     VD_AGENT_SET_CAPABILITY(caps->caps, VD_AGENT_CAP_MAX_CLIPBOARD);
+    /* Kyvenza: 见 VD_AGENT_CAP_KYVENZA_CLIPBOARD_FILE_LIST 处的说明。 */
+    VD_AGENT_SET_CAPABILITY(caps->caps, VD_AGENT_CAP_KYVENZA_CLIPBOARD_FILE_LIST);
     vd_printf("Sending capabilities:");
     for (uint32_t i = 0 ; i < caps_size; ++i) {
         vd_printf("%X", caps->caps[i]);
